examples.quote:
I therefore respectfully urge the Commission to:
1.	Reject any proposal to sunset or eliminate the E-Rate program;
2.	Reject proposals that would unnecessarily narrow E-Rate eligibility or restrict support based solely on geography or other criteria that would leave students without adequate support;
3.	Preserve support for the connectivity and internal network infrastructure schools need to provide reliable educational access; and
4.	Work with schools and other stakeholders to strengthen and modernize E-Rate rather than reduce its role in public education.
